### 测试修改预约时服务不存在
PUT http://localhost:8080/appointments/17
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 3,
  "serviceId": 99999,
  "staffId": 2,
  "appointmentTime": "2026-10-13T10:00:00",
  "status": "PENDING"
}

### 确认修改失败后预约数据没有变化
GET http://localhost:8080/appointments/17

### 测试修改预约时不能改成过去时间
PUT http://localhost:8080/appointments/17
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 3,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "staffId": 2,
  "appointmentTime": "2026-09-01T10:00:00",
  "status": "PENDING"
}

